data: {"answer": "This is the **Bakery · Supplier Portal** room. It shows how the bakery receives orders via the **Supplier Portal**. You can see controls for **Vendor Risk Management**, **Individual Accounts (No Shared Logins)**, and a threat of **Third-Party & Supply-Chain Compromise**. There is **1 hidden security weakness** in this room that you have not found yet.", "go": [], "followups": [{"text": "What does the Supplier Portal do?", "en": "What does the Supplier Portal do?", "zh": "供應商入口網站是做什麼的？"}, {"text": "How do we prevent Third-Party & Supply-Chain compromise?", "en": "How do we prevent Third-Party & Supply-Chain compromise?", "zh": "第三方與供應鏈入侵要怎麼防？"}, {"text": "What should I do next?", "en": "What should I do next?", "zh": "接下來要去哪？"}], "trace": {"session": "offline", "lang": "en", "model": "qwen3.5:9b", "timings": {"route_s": 0.0, "tool_s": 0.01, "answer_s": 9.19, "total_s": 9.2}, "route": {"tool": "room_overview", "target": "", "how": "button"}, "link": {"query": "(current room)", "chosen": "bakery_in", "how": "current room"}, "redirect": "", "queries": [{"purpose": "everything placed in this room", "cypher": "MATCH (r:Room {key:$k}) RETURN r {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh} AS r, [(r)-[:IN_AREA]->(a) | a {.key, .name_en, .name_zh}][0] AS area, [(r)-[:CLOSEUP_OF]->(p) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh}][0] AS parent, [(s:System)-[:LOCATED_IN]->(r) | s {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS systems, [(t:Threat)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | t {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS threats, [(c:Control)-[:SEEN_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .type}] AS controls, [(c:Concept)-[:TAUGHT_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS concepts, [(p:Procedure)-[:PRACTISED_IN]->(r) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .kind}] AS procedures, [(d:Department)-[:BASED_IN]->(r) | d {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .ext}] AS departments, [(cs:CaseStudy)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | cs {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .year}] AS cases, [(r)-[l:LINKS_TO]->(x) | x {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh, teleport: l.teleport}] AS exits, size([(f:Finding)-[:IN_ROOM]->(r) | f]) AS findings_here", "params": {"k": "bakery_in"}, "rows": 1, "ms": 5.7}], "graph": {"nodes": [{"key": "bakery_in", "label": "Room", "en": "Bakery", "zh": "麵包店"}, {"key": "supplier_portal", "label": "System", "en": "Supplier Portal", "zh": "供應商入口網站"}, {"key": "supply_chain", "label": "Threat", "en": "Third-Party & Supply-Chain Compromise", "zh": "第三方與供應鏈入侵"}, {"key": "vendor_management", "label": "Control", "en": "Vendor Risk Management", "zh": "廠商風險管理"}, {"key": "unique_ids", "label": "Control", "en": "Individual Accounts (No Shared Logins)", "zh": "個人帳號（不共用）"}], "edges": [{"a": "vendor_management", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "bakery_in"}, {"a": "vendor_management", "t": "PROTECTS", "b": "supplier_portal"}, {"a": "vendor_management", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "supply_chain"}, {"a": "supplier_portal", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "bakery_in"}, {"a": "supply_chain", "t": "TARGETS", "b": "supplier_portal"}, {"a": "supply_chain", "t": "SHOWN_IN", "b": "bakery_in"}, {"a": "unique_ids", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "bakery_in"}, {"a": "unique_ids", "t": "PROTECTS", "b": "supplier_portal"}, {"a": "unique_ids", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "supply_chain"}]}, "tool_used": "room_overview", "facts": "Room: Bakery · Supplier Portal\nWhat it shows: The bakery receives the resort's orders through the supplier portal.\nKey lesson: Every supplier user needs their own login, never a shared one.\nSystems here: Supplier Portal\nThreats shown here: Third-Party & Supply-Chain Compromise\nControls you can see: Vendor Risk Management, Individual Accounts (No Shared 